      "squareFooting": "Preserve capture-time worldY depth correction belowZ.42 after facing rotation; undeformed full-cell geometry and expanded capture geometry are distinct. Use once. Ground-plane depth atZ0 projects128 logical pixels per world cell while upper native unitDepth is73.41776.",
      "facings": "Native root rotation convention S0,E+90,N180,W-90 degrees. Export labeled N/E/S/W from actual native geometry; no flipped or raster-rotated views.",
      "animation": "Only static one frame,12fps,nonloop. No armature,actions or animated clip required; legacy idle recipe string does not add one.",
      "lightsAndOutput": "Native editable3D output; no target image plane, painted-over export, per-facing recolor, target halo, bloom or cast ground shadow. Keep horizontal lighting balance and native lower-height material separation. Current source has centered140W overhead plus four equal100W cardinal fills and135% sRGB compositor with alpha bypass; the warm redesign may improve native material/light implementation while preserving required rotational balance and capture contract, as frozen by coordinator.",
